WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.113
Dimension of self-similar measures.

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:04.601
Apply random shrinking maps forever.

3
00:00:04.751 --> 00:00:08.457
Exact overlaps waste randomness; the claim is nothing else does.

4
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.704
Lost randomness must show up as fair coin flips at finer scales.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:17.278
Claimed: dimension is entropy over contraction.

6
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:18.946
Checked in Lean.
